n style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为物种 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 在像素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的花粉资源丰度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为飞行距离参数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为筑巢适宜性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"aries-模型\">ARIES 模型</h4><p>ARIES（Artificial Intelligence for Ecosystem Services）采用贝叶斯网络和 Agent-Based 模型量化 ES 的空间流动：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>供给端</strong>（Source）：ES 产生的位置</li>\n<li><strong>需求端</strong>（Use）：ES 被消费的位置</li>\n<li><strong>流动路径</strong>（Flow）：ES 从供给到需求的空间传递</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种&quot;源—汇—流&quot;框架比 InVEST 的静态供给模型更好地捕获了 ES 的空间非均匀分布。例如，水净化服务的实际受益取决于上游污染源、中途的自然过滤过程和下游取水点的空间关系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"经济估值方法\">经济估值方法</h3><p>生态系统服务的货币化估值为将 ES 纳入成本效益分析和政策工具设计提供了通用度量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用服务类型</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场价格法</td>\n<td>直接观察市场交易价格</td>\n<td>供给服务（食物、木材）</td>\n<td>仅适用于可交易商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>替代成本法</td>\n<td>ES 功能的人工替代成本</td>\n<td>授粉（人工授粉成本）、水净化（净水厂成本）</td>\n<td>可能高估或低估真实价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旅行费用法</td>\n<td>消费者为体验 ES 支付的旅行成本</td>\n<td>文化服务（休闲、旅游）</td>\n<td>仅反映使用价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择实验</td>\n<td>通过假设市场的偏好表述</td>\n<td>非市场服务、存在价值</td>\n<td>假设偏差（WTP-WTA 差距）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效益转移</td>\n<td>将已有研究结果转移到新地点</td>\n<td>快速评估</td>\n<td>转移误差可达 30-50%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Costanza 等人（2014 年更新）估算全球生态系统服务总价值为每年 $125 万亿（2011 年美元），但这一数字的意义和局限性饱受争议。核心争论在于：边际价值 vs. 总价值——生态系统服务的总价值理论上趋于无穷（人类生存依赖生态系统），政策相关的是边际变化的价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"农业景观中的-es-权衡分析\">农业景观中的 ES 权衡分析</h3><p>农业集约化往往在增加供给服务（产量）的同时减少调节服务（授粉、碳汇、水净化）。量化这种权衡需要：</p>\n<p><strong>生产边界分析</strong>：构建效率前沿（production possibility frontier, PPF）来评估多个 ES 之间的权衡关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\sum_{k} w_k \\cdot ES_k(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>L</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{s.t.} \\quad L \\in \\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ES_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 项服务，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为景观配置方案，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为可行景观空间。</p>\n<p>帕累托最优解集揭示了在不降低任何一项服务的前提下无法再提高其他服务的景观方案。</p>\n<p>**土地共享 vs 土地分离（Land Sharing vs Land Sparing）**是农业景观 ES 管理的核心争论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Land Sharing</strong>：在农田内部整合生物多样性保护（如农林复合系统、花带种植），每单位面积产量较低但 ES 多样性更高</li>\n<li><strong>Land Sparing</strong>：高强度种植集中化，释放土地用于保护区，总产量和总生物多样性可能同时更高</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一争论的实证证据取决于产量—生物多样性关系的凸凹性。如果关系为凸函数（低强度即导致大量物种丧失），Land Sparing 更优；如果为凹函数（中等强度仍维持较高多样性），Land Sharing 更优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生态系统服务支付-pes\">生态系统服务支付（PES）</h3><p>PES 将 ES 量化结果转化为激励机制，为 ES 供给者（通常是农户）提供经济补偿：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PES 类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>典型案例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳市场</td>\n<td>碳信用交易</td>\n<td>农田碳汇交易（Verra VCS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水源保护基金</td>\n<td>下游用水者付费给上游管理者</td>\n<td>纽约市—Catskill 水源地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物多样性补贴</td>\n<td>政府为生态友好管理措施付费</td>\n<td>EU CAP 绿色支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证溢价</td>\n<td>消费者为可持续认证产品支付更高价格</td>\n<td>有机认证、雨林联盟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有效的 PES 设计需要解决四个核心问题：额外性（additionality）——是否真的改变了行为；持久性（permanence）——ES 改善是否持续；泄漏（leakage）——补偿区域外的负面转移效应；条件性（conditionality）——支付与 ES 供给的挂钩机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>使用 InVEST 的授粉模型评估某农业景观中移除 20% 半自然栖息地后授粉服务的变化。描述模型的输入数据需求（空间数据、蜜蜂参数），并讨论模型假设的局限性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某 PES 项目为农户保留田间缓冲带每年支付 200 美元/公顷。如果农户因此每年损失 300 美元/公顷的作物收入，PES 项目是否有效？用额外性和机会成本的概念分析。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 Land Sharing 和 Land Sparing 两种策略在以下场景中的优劣：热带低地，目标是同时维持水稻产量和候鸟栖息地。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论将生态系统服务货币化的伦理争议。为什么一些学者认为将自然&quot;定价&quot;可能适得其反？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Sharp, R. et al. (2020). <em>InVEST User&#39;s Guide</em>. The Natural Capital Project — InVEST 模型的官方文档。</li>\n<li>Costanza, R. et al. (2014). &quot;Changes in the global value of ecosystem services.&quot; <em>Global Environmental Change</em> — 全球 ES 估值更新。</li>\n<li>Wunder, S. (2015). &quot;Revisiting the concept of payments for environmental services.&quot; <em>Ecological Economics</em> — PES 概念的批判性审视。</li>\n<li>IPBES (2019). <em>Global Assessment Report on Biodiversity and Ecosystem Services</em> — IPBES 全球评估旗舰报告。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生态系统服务量化连接了生态学知识与政策决策。从 InVEST 和 ARIES 等空间模型的生物物理估算，到选择实验和效益转移的经济估值，方法工具箱日益完善。但量化本身不是目的——ES 研究的核心价值在于揭示农业集约化与生态保护之间的权衡关系，并为 PES 等激励机制提供科学设计依据。农学研究者应警惕将复杂的生态过程简化为单一数字的诱惑，始终关注估值背后的假设和不确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-相关专题\">本 hub 相关专题</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"life-cycle-assessment\">农业生命周期评价</a>：LCA 从&quot;每单位产品的环境负担&quot;切入，生态系统服务量化从&quot;景观提供的生态收益&quot;切入，两者拼合才是完整的可持续性图景。</li>\n<li><a href=\"socio-ecological-resilience\">社会—生态韧性指标</a>：服务权衡分析与 PES 激励机制是韧性建设中&quot;适应路径&quot;的生态与经济基础。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士农学 — 生态系统服务量化","id":"博士农学-生态系统服务量化"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"从 MEA 到 IPBES 的框架演进","id":"从-mea-到-ipbes-的框架演进"},{"level":3,"text":"生物物理量化方法","id":"生物物理量化方法"},{"level":4,"text":"InVEST 模型套件","id":"invest-模型套件"},{"level":4,"text":"ARIES 模型","id":"aries-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"经济估值方法","id":"经济估值方法"},{"level":3,"text":"农业景观中的 ES 权衡分析","id":"农业景观中的-es-权衡分析"},{"level":3,"text":"生态系统服务支付（PES）","id":"生态系统服务支付-pes"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本 hub 相关专题","id":"本-hub-相关专题"}],"prev":{"title":"博士农学 — 农业生命周期评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/agricultural-research/sustainability-metrics/life-cycle-assessment"},"next":{"title":"博士农学 — 社会—生态韧性指标","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/agriculture/agricultural-research/sustainability-metrics/socio-ecological-resilience"}}